    <string name="puzzle_instructions_numbers">Sort the tiles from 1 to 15, starting from the top left corner and going horizontally. You can only move tiles adjacent to the empty space. Solve the puzzle as quickly and with as few moves as possible!</string>
    <string name="puzzle_instructions_image">Pick a photo, crop it to a square, and then slide the tiles around the empty space until the full picture is restored with the fewest moves and in the shortest time you can.</string>
